{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/ee55a53cadfebad82ecb8eebbfbc735e.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ancient Dungeon VR</strong>.\u00a0This is a fast and fun dungeon roguelite game made just for VR. Swing your sword, grab loot, and explore rooms full of traps, secrets, and monsters. The dungeons change every time you play! It\u2019s one of the best-rated VR games out there with <strong>Overwhelmingly Positive</strong>\u00a0reviews, and you can play for many hours with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/b29039f40c3b1528e5181cc63c03d4bd.poster.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/b29039f40c3b1528e5181cc63c03d4bd.webm?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/b29039f40c3b1528e5181cc63c03d4bd.mp4?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Online Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in multiplayer. Trade blows with dungeon bosses, share loot, and revive each other\u2026 or let them get caught while you grab the loot. Your choice. Multiplayer supports up to 4 players, cross-play with Quest native and soon PSVR2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/c52eb7b2f99723ed2ddd14d106a2bb0c.poster.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/c52eb7b2f99723ed2ddd14d106a2bb0c.webm?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/c52eb7b2f99723ed2ddd14d106a2bb0c.mp4?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Dungeons Every Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same! Every time you play, the dungeon looks different, with new monsters and loot. You can unlock secret rooms, new floors, and cool surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/00e3ee10927e42c02cdf062a16eb0624.poster.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/00e3ee10927e42c02cdf062a16eb0624.webm?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/00e3ee10927e42c02cdf062a16eb0624.mp4?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Combat. Real Movement. Real Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, block, throw, and dodge, all with your real hands in VR! You can even cut down plants if you\u2019re feeling silly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/85a9bb4f5f3ebbd0ab8cea0214a890ea.poster.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/85a9bb4f5f3ebbd0ab8cea0214a890ea.webm?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/85a9bb4f5f3ebbd0ab8cea0214a890ea.mp4?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique  Powerups, Countless Builds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find special items called Relics that make you stronger or give you new powers. Will you become a glass cannon? A tanky swordsman? Or maybe something... <i>cursed?</i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/7315b689609de1281901eef96a0ec3f5.poster.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/7315b689609de1281901eef96a0ec3f5.webm?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/7315b689609de1281901eef96a0ec3f5.mp4?t=1775740194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Permanent Unlocks &amp; Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent rewards like new weapons, floors, relics, upgrades, hard mode, and more! Every adventure helps you build power and unlock fresh challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based VR combat: feel every swing and throw</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich roguelite progression with hundreds of combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with up to 4 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 unique enemies, 11 bosses, 150+ relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, teleport, or even swing like a monkey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new floors and mini encounters for more variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your monster kills, stats, and trophies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression system via Bestiary, Item Compendiums and Lore Entries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always getting new updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods supported too!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125240/extras/31c215122cea939c370937b0296fd77d.avif?t=1775740194\" width=600 height=125 /></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1c3fd2f881539b2f44d2904c1044b4ed24626b2b.jpg","localized_name":"A Battle Won","name":"A Battle Won","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1125240/1c3fd2f881539b2f44d2904c1044b4ed24626b2b.jpg"},{"icon":"8bc273f2909e03da19d976d4394f11bde7693d9f.jpg","localized_name":"A Contract Completed","name":"A Contract Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1125240/8bc273f2909e03da19d976d4394f11bde7693d9f.jpg"},{"icon":"98864feb3f7de537ceb71d6f9252dcd075913e94.jpg","localized_name":"Aberration Obliteration","name":"Aberration Obliteration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1125240/98864feb3f7de537ceb71d6f9252dcd075913e94.jpg"},{"icon":"dc9e9220f55e5e46acbf86ae4e91cf16142bb0dc.jpg","localized_name":"Attics Anonymous","name":"Attics Anonymous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1125240/dc9e9220f55e5e46acbf86ae4e91cf16142bb0dc.jpg"},{"icon":"3da8ce1119bd3960f9bab08b27f7f893131e77ba.jpg","localized_name":"Big Spender","name":"Big Spender","path"